  "details": "- CVE-2026-55677: stop unescaping the static file wildcard by default in\n  Static, StaticFS, Group.StaticFS and StaticWithConfig of the vendored\n  github.com/labstack/echo/v4 (the echo v4.15.4 fix), so an encoded\n  separator (%2F, %5C) or dot-segment (%2E%2E) cannot resolve a static\n  file outside the route the router matched and bypass route-level\n  middleware; unescaping is opt-in via EnablePathUnescapingStaticFiles\n  and StaticConfig.EnablePathUnescaping",
